<h2 class="h4 mb-2">Need it to work your way?</h2>
<p class="text-body-secondary">Every organization moves people a little differently. Tell us your rules and we'll build them into
  your matching — the same day for simple ones.</p>
<ul class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">
  <li>Union or civil-service seniority dates, bidding rounds, tie-breakers</li>
  <li>Same shift, department, unit or license level before two people can swap</li>
  <li>Minimum time in role, blackout periods, distance limits between sites</li>
  <li>Extra approval steps, e.g. both site managers sign off</li>
  <li>Imports straight from your HR system's export format</li>
</ul>
